            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12285999?u=183d27a6aca0718cb83ecec3c8e7745502384f48&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated to add a <code class=\"notranslate\">position-try</code> reference in the introductory paragraph of the “Positioning elements relative to their anchor” section.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40711.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3315600043\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40711\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40711/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40711\">#40711</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
