        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193881290?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40902.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3358556428\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40902\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40902/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40902\">#40902</a></h3>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added clarification for the auto keyword and fallback values in the sizes attribute of the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a> element. This ensures developers know how to maintain backward compatibility for browsers that do not support auto.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Problem</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The existing MDN documentation did not mention:<br>\nHow to specify fallback values when using auto.<br>\nThe importance of ordering fallback values for older browsers.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What Changed</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated the sizes attribute description.<br>\nAdded note about backward compatibility.<br>\nIncluded an example from the HTML specification.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Before</h3>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/193881290/482645137-50e95055-7ae2-4efa-a914-cb516915bde9.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NTYzMDA0MTAsIm5iZiI6MTc1NjMwMDExMCwicGF0aCI6Ii8xOTM4ODEyOTAvNDgyNjQ1MTM3LTUwZTk1MDU1LTdhZTItNGVmYS1hOTE0LWNiNTE2OTE1YmRlOS5wbmc_.4WkKESr9t-XyuchM5OHhjWrOPFgYElDN42WNEgnKBmI\"><img width=\"783\" height=\"684\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/193881290/482645137-50e95055-7ae2-4efa-a914-cb516915bde9.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NTYzMDA0MTAsIm5iZiI6MTc1NjMwMDExMCwicGF0aCI6Ii8xOTM4ODEyOTAvNDgyNjQ1MTM3LTUwZTk1MDU1LTdhZTItNGVmYS1hOTE0LWNiNTE2OTE1YmRlOS5wbmc_.4WkKESr9t-XyuchM5OHhjWrOPFgYElDN42WNEgnKBmI\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 684px;\"></a>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">After</h3>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/193881290/482645310-85b658af-84f3-4399-a893-0f14ea6bdcad.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NTYzMDA0MTAsIm5iZiI6MTc1NjMwMDExMCwicGF0aCI6Ii8xOTM4ODEyOTAvNDgyNjQ1MzEwLTg1YjY1OGFmLTg0ZjMtNDM5OS1hODkzLTBmMTRlYTZiZGNhZC5wbmc_.oChq34mio-U9R-zp2mddaNdlalrgGtvEb5cHeKN8n38\"><img width=\"800\" height=\"720\" alt=\"after\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/193881290/482645310-85b658af-84f3-4399-a893-0f14ea6bdcad.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NTYzMDA0MTAsIm5iZiI6MTc1NjMwMDExMCwicGF0aCI6Ii8xOTM4ODEyOTAvNDgyNjQ1MzEwLTg1YjY1OGFmLTg0ZjMtNDM5OS1hODkzLTBmMTRlYTZiZGNhZC5wbmc_.oChq34mio-U9R-zp2mddaNdlalrgGtvEb5cHeKN8n38\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 720px;\"></a>",
