        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm updating the section that describes the status line to show that the reason phrase is optional.<br>\nI haven't looked at updating other sections for renaming, I'm not sure how much work this would be just yet, it may not be worth the churn.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2713854858\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37057\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/37057/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37057\">#37057</a></p>",
