        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR is part of a series in which I update the Learn area \"Challenge\" articles. In general, they need to be modernized, restructured, and put in better positions in the modules so they are spaced out better and test subjects that have already been covered.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR improves the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content/Mozilla_splash_page\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mozilla splash page challenge</a>. Specifically, it:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Provides a completely new challenge, with new assets, which tests images/figures/videos.</li>\n<li>Streamlines the question wording and presents the sample text to work on in the example. In general, the presentation has been made consistent with the new marking up a letter challenge.</li>\n<li>Includes a summary/detail containing the final markup, to allow the reader to self-assess more easily.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #32082.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2115184376\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32082\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/32082/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32082\">#32082</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40878",
            "title": "Update splash page challenge",
